=== Simple Path to 255 ===

This will take a lot of manual combines until you manage to succeed on a potion and learn the recipe, but it only requires three ingredients and each combine only costs about 1pp. All three can be bought from [[Sithgok]] in [[Innothule Swamp]] or [[Sven Felligan]] in [[Everfrost Peaks]].

'''1 - 202 Skill'''
* [[Mystical Infusion]]
** 2x [[Sickle Leaf]]

'''202 - 255 Skill'''
* [[Potion of Mystical Aptitude]]
** 1x [[Yerbhimba]]
** 1x [[Duskglow Vine]]

=== After Skill 255 ===

After the [[Potion of Mystical Aptitude]] at trivial 255, there is a large gap in what can be crafted, and the next craftable recipes are at trivial 302. They do require more ingredients, but most can be purchased at vendors. One does require farming in [[Kedge Keep]]. However, since these are the highest level recipes craftable, the Alchemy leveling journey could be considered complete any time after skill 255. **Note: The Distillate IX recipes do not appear to work at this time, with the exception of Distillate of Replenishment IX (level 60 to use). Alchemy 255 and AA Alchemy mastery maxxed out and they will not combine.

