== Recipes ==

These are the recipes available in EverQuest Legends. Some are not necessarily from the "original" or "classic" era, but the ingredients are available, the recipes combine, and they are visible in the trivial list inside the [[Medicine Bag]] or [[Reinforced Medicine Bag]].

'''Please note''' that the [[Medicine Bag]] only has 8 slots for combines, so any recipe with more than 8 ingredients requires the [[Reinforced Medicine Bag]]!

=== A note on potion stacking and inventory space ===

Unlike P99 and classic EverQuest, there are no 5-dose or 10-dose potions in EverQuest Legends; most potions instead stack to 10 by default. As an alternative to storing multiple stacks of potions in inventory, the tradeskill depot can store very large stacks of ingredients and can be used during recipe combinations.

