== Supplies ==

Alchemy reagents are sold all over Norrath, and different vendors sell different ingredients. It may require a bit of travel to find what you need. As always, Charisma and faction with the vendor can drastically sway material prices. 

=== Vendors ===

==== Evil ====

* [[Innothule Swamp]] has three Troll vendors which have ''most'' of the ingredients
** [[Clork]], [[Murak]], and [[Sithgok]] on the Northern stone hand
* [[Grobb]] has five vendors 
** [[Bahagg]], [[Blergagg]], [[Blergab]], and [[Grabah]] are near the Shaman guild
** [[Raztara]] is around the corner to the North
* [[Oggok]] has four vendors
** [[Bardopa]], [[Garakbar]], [[Garakpor]], and [[Pordopa]] are just Northwest of the bank, in a room with a floating decorative skull
* [[Paineel]] has a single vendor
**  [[Yvonne Ani]] is in a store called "Poison Petal" in an upstairs building near the bank

==== Good ====

* [[Ak'Anon]] has one vendor
** [[A Clockwork Alchemist]], with the clockwork grocer and baker on the way to the palace, at #12 on the map
* [[Halas]] has five vendors
** [[Berit]], [[Dargon]], [[Petra]], and [[Spirita]] arelocated right next to the Shaman guild on the West side of Halas
** [[Murtog MacYee]] is on the East side, in Yee Majik
* [[Everfrost Peaks]] has three vendors 
** [[Guri]], [[Hern Bearjumper]], and [[Sven Felligan]] are at the Temple to the North, just West of the West-most ice river branch
* [[Rivervale]] has one vendor
** [[Kizzie Mintopp]] is directly South of the bank

==== Independent ====

Colorful merchants around the world have a smaller set of lesser-used ingredients such as [[Balm Leaves]], [[Dragonwart]], [[Elf Leaf]], and [[Larkspur]]
* [[Kithicor Forest]]
** [[Elsbyth]], in a small building on the South wall in the West quadrant
* [[Lake Rathetear]]
** [[Dreana]], in the camp on the South wall
* [[Northern Karana]]
** [[Romella]], in the camp in the center of the zone
* [[Oasis of Marr]]
** [[Isslana]], in the camp just North of the lake
* [[Rathe Mountains]]
** [[Viira Bali]] and [[Susanna]] at the  Paladin camp
** [[Chandra Kali]], just East of the [[Lake Rathetear]] zone line

==== Out of Era ====

* Some vendors are not available now, but may be in game when the lands appear
** [[Kerra Island]] - located right next to the Temple of Kerrans.
** [[Firiona Vie]] - [[Shelae Wolfkin]] and [[Marlyn McMerin]], located on the docks.
** [[Cabilis]] - [[Jaxxtz]], in the middle of [[West Cabilis]] in a small hut. [Velious]
** [[Cabilis]] - [[Klok Scaleroot]] in [[West Cabilis]], (400, 515) near the necromancer guild

